Package: v2ray-client
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         python3 (>= 3.8),
         python3-pyqt6,
         python3-requests,
         curl,
         wget
Recommends: v2ray
Description: Modern V2Ray VPN Client for Ubuntu
 A modern, user-friendly V2Ray client application for Ubuntu with a
 colorful graphical interface built using PyQt6.
 .
 Features:
  - Manage multiple subscription URLs
  - One-click server connection
  - Automatic server list updates
  - Live connection logs
  - Multiple visual themes (Dark, Light, Neon)
  - Server ping measurement
  - Country flags and server information display
 .
 This package provides the client application. V2Ray Core must be
 installed separately for the application to function.
